mandel-recover.m's zoom on the machine's GPU (docs/INPROGRESS.md, Failure,
step 4, D1): its places, GPU processes with a share of the kernel's teams
each, give mandel.m's iterations (mandel-gpu.test) with no faults; with
MERK_FAULTS stopping places at random, which end at their next receive and
leave their slots dead, while the coordinator gives their chunks back out
to new places; and with MERK_FAULTS ending the whole kernel, every place at
once, after which the new places start a new kernel. On 64 pixels square in
tiles of 8 for 12 frames, and on 512 in tiles of 32 for the whole zoom.
REQUIRES: amdgpu-gpu

RUN: merkc -O2 -fopenmp -fdo-loops -fprocess-declarations --offload-arch=%offload-arch %libomp-flags %S/../../benchmarks/mandel/mandel-recover.m -o %t 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=QUIET --allow-empty
QUIET-NOT: warning:
RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=4 timeout -k 1 60 %t | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=SMALL,NONE
RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=4 MERK_FAULTS="seed=1 mtbf=5 fail=order count=10" timeout -k 1 60 %t 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SMALL
RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=2 MANDEL_CHUNK=1 MERK_FAULTS="seed=2 mtbf=5 fail=order count=10" timeout -k 1 60 %t 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SMALL
RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=64 MANDEL_TILE=8 MANDEL_FRAMES=12 MANDEL_PLACES=4 MERK_FAULTS="seed=3 mtbf=10 kernel count=3" timeout -k 1 60 %t 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SMALL
SMALL: Iterations: 10601425
SMALL-NEXT: Checksum: 63198496
NONE-NEXT: Places lost: 0
NONE-NEXT: Tiles given back: 0

RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=512 MANDEL_TILE=32 MERK_FAULTS="seed=4 mtbf=100 fail=order count=20" timeout -k 1 120 %t 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ZOOM
RUN: %gpu-env MANDEL_SIZE=512 MANDEL_TILE=32 MERK_FAULTS="seed=5 mtbf=300 kernel count=3" timeout -k 1 120 %t 2>/dev/null | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=ZOOM
ZOOM: Frames: 40 of 512 x 512 pixels, tiles of 32 x 32
ZOOM: Iterations: 8362906608
ZOOM-NEXT: Checksum: 237665807406
